WEBVTT

00:15:58.036 --> 00:16:00.497
presidents and top-down
structures of management.

00:16:01.623 --> 00:16:04.418
And there are also some
contemporary implications.

00:16:04.459 --> 00:16:07.295
Take, for example, the commonplace notion

00:16:07.295 --> 00:16:12.759
that participatory democracy is somehow
natural in a small community.

00:16:13.093 --> 00:16:15.178
Or perhaps an activist group,

00:16:15.178 --> 00:16:20.267
but couldn't possibly have a scale up
for anything like a city,

00:16:20.308 --> 00:16:22.436
a nation or even a region.

00:16:23.228 --> 00:16:25.689
Well, actually, the evidence
of human history,

00:16:25.689 --> 00:16:27.858
if we're prepared to look at it,

00:16:27.858 --> 00:16:29.526
suggests the opposite.